#Протокол_PVRG_Graph_RAG_Minimal<[
Базис:
  PVRG/Graph RAG нужен новой сборке как derived context layer для агента, dashboard and retrieval, но не как новый source of truth или wholesale порт старого PVRG.
  Work Graph, Evidence v1, Project Memory v1, Language Adapter Layer, OneBase artifact mapping and derived graph viewer уже задают источники фактов и границы отображения.
  Минимальный slice должен сначала отвечать на вопросы текущей задачи: что связано, почему связано, какие решения уже были приняты and what evidence exists.
Вектор:
  Build pvrg.graph_rag.slice.v1 as deterministic JSON derived from Work Graph snapshot, Evidence records, MemoryRecord export, language/domain adapter projections and OneBase mappings.
  Include only node types WorkItem, file/artifact, Evidence, MemoryRecord, domain object and ProviderRun; include typed edges from target_files, depends_on, evidence refs, adapter facts and OneBase domain mappings.
  Retrieval starts as graph expansion and ranked filtering over JSON nodes/edges; semantic vector index, ANN and binary GBC cache are deferred until volume/latency requires them.
Цель:
  Agent worker получает компактный связанный context slice for current WorkItem without reading the whole repo, replaying transcripts or copying the old PVRG implementation.

Проверки:
  graph/RAG scope ограничен derived context
  описаны minimal node/edge types для first OneBase path
  retrieval query связан с current WorkItem, related artifacts, blockers and previous decisions
  first implementation is JSON derived graph/RAG slice, not full old PVRG
  non-goals explicitly defer semantic vector index, ANN, GBC binary cache and old PVRG wholesale port

Метки:
  atom.profile: plan
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  design.input: workgraph.snapshot.v1, evidence-record-v1, memory-record-v1, adapter-projection-v1, onebase-artifact-mapping, worker-output-v1
  design.output: pvrg.graph_rag.slice.v1
  work.source: design-pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Minimal_Node_Types<[
Базис:
  Node types must mirror existing contracts so the slice can be rebuilt from source artifacts and inspected by the derived graph viewer.
Вектор:
  WorkItem node: id, title, status, ownerRole, department, priority, risk, dependsOn, targetFiles, traceRefs, blocker, nextAction and traceStatus from workgraph.snapshot.v1.
  FileArtifact node: stable path or artifact id, kind, adapterId, language/domain profile, confidence, source ranges and optional hash when producer exposes it.
  Evidence node: Evidence Record v1 id, taskId, type, source, status, summary, artifacts, command, provider, runId and time; legacy evidence strings can be imported as low-structure evidence summaries.
  MemoryRecord node: MemoryRecord v1 id, type, status, confidence, summary, sourceWorkItem, evidenceIds, relatedFiles and relatedTasks.
  DomainObject node: domain id plus kind/name/source file; for OneBase this covers document, catalog, register, report, widget, posting script, procedure and runtime artifact nodes from adapter mappings.
  ProviderRun node: provider, runId, taskId, status, startedAt, finishedAt, producedEvidenceIds, failureReason and retryAdvice from Worker Output/provider run summaries.
Цель:
  The first slice connects operational work, source artifacts, domain facts, evidence, memory and provider execution without introducing a separate graph database schema.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: pvrg-minimal-node-types-v1
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Minimal_Edge_And_Source_Signals<[
Базис:
  Edges must explain source fields and confidence, because retrieval results need to be reviewable and not just ranked guesses.
Вектор:
  depends_on: WorkItem dependency -> dependent WorkItem from work.depends_on and snapshot edges.
  targets: WorkItem -> FileArtifact/DomainObject from work.target_files, structured evidence artifacts and adapter-resolved artifact refs.
  has_evidence: WorkItem -> Evidence from Evidence Record v1 taskId or imported legacy evidence.
  cites_evidence: MemoryRecord -> Evidence from memory.evidenceIds; Evidence -> FileArtifact from evidence.artifacts.
  writes_memory: WorkItem/Evidence -> MemoryRecord from sourceWorkItem, relatedTasks and evidenceIds.
  produced_by_run: ProviderRun -> Evidence and ProviderRun -> WorkItem from worker output/run summaries.
  adapter_fact: FileArtifact -> DomainObject, FileArtifact -> FileArtifact or DomainObject -> DomainObject from language adapter symbols/imports/traceLinks/domainMetadata.
  onebase_mapping: OneBase document -> posting script -> registers -> reports/widgets from domains/onebase/artifact-mapping.bvc and adapter projections.
  blocked_by: WorkItem -> Evidence/MemoryRecord/WorkItem from blocker text, blocker evidence, unresolved open-question memory or unsatisfied dependency.
Цель:
  Source signals are target_files, depends_on, evidence refs, language adapter facts and OneBase mappings, each carrying sourceField, confidence and optional trace ref.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: pvrg-minimal-edge-types-v1
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Retrieval_Use_Cases<[
Базис:
  MVP retrieval should serve agent context construction and operator explanation before trying broad semantic search.
Вектор:
  Current task context: start from current WorkItem, include direct dependencies, dependents, target files/artifacts, relevant adapter facts, recent evidence and active memory decisions/invariants.
  Related artifacts: expand from target_files through adapter facts and OneBase mappings to domain objects, tests, reports, widgets, posting scripts and verification hints.
  Blockers: retrieve blocked WorkItems, blocker evidence, failed ProviderRuns, open-question memory and dependency chains that prevent ready status.
  Previous decisions: retrieve MemoryRecord type decision, invariant, architecture-fact and domain-fact records linked by sourceWorkItem, relatedFiles, relatedTasks, evidenceIds or domain object.
  Verification context: retrieve Evidence and command/test hints for files/domain objects touched by the task, plus prior failed/succeeded runs for the same surface.
Цель:
  A worker can request a bounded retrieval slice for plan/act/verify without loading all protocols, all memory or all source files.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: pvrg-minimal-retrieval-use-cases
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#First_Implementation_JSON_Slice<[
Базис:
  Existing runtime already has JSON snapshots and the graph viewer already expects rebuildable derived graph data.
Вектор:
  Implement first as buildGraphRagSlice({ workgraphSnapshot, evidenceRecords, memoryRecords, adapterProjections, providerRuns }) returning JSON nodes, edges, indexes and retrieval helpers.
  Required JSON fields: sliceVersion, generatedAt, nodes, edges, sourceInputs, warnings and retrievalProfiles.
  Nodes and edges use stable ids, kind/type, label/summary, sourceRefs, confidence and sourceField; no persisted layout, no graph DB and no hidden provider session state.
  Retrieval helpers can be deterministic functions over JSON: getCurrentTaskContext(taskId), getRelatedArtifacts(ref), getBlockers(taskId or all), getPreviousDecisions(scope).
  UI relation: derived graph viewer consumes the same nodes/edges for visualization; Graph RAG adds retrieval profiles and ranking/filtering over that projection.
Цель:
  First implementation is small, testable and compatible with Work Graph snapshots, Project Memory and the read-only derived graph viewer.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: pvrg-first-json-slice
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Relation_To_Memory_And_Graph_Viewer<[
Базис:
  Project Memory and derived graph viewer already cover durable context and visual explanation, so Graph RAG must compose them instead of replacing them.
Вектор:
  Project Memory remains the source for durable decisions, invariants, risks, open questions and domain facts; Graph RAG indexes MemoryRecord nodes as derived context only.
  Evidence remains the proof layer; Graph RAG uses Evidence nodes to explain why a relation or decision is trusted.
  Language/domain adapters remain the producers of structured file/domain facts; Graph RAG stores their projections with confidence and source refs, not raw parser internals.
  Derived graph viewer renders nodes/edges for operator navigation; Graph RAG uses the same projection for agent retrieval and can add profile-specific ranking.
  Work Graph remains canonical for task state, dependencies, target files, blocker and done/verify evidence gates.
Цель:
  Graph RAG is a context projection over existing contracts, not a competing memory store, graph editor or orchestration layer.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: pvrg-memory-viewer-boundary
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Non_Goals_Deferred<[
Базис:
  Старый PVRG contained useful ideas, but copying it wholesale would overfit the rebuild before the minimal loop is proven.
Вектор:
  Non-goal: full semantic vector index as the first retrieval layer; lexical/typed graph filtering over JSON is enough for MVP.
  Non-goal: ANN service, embeddings daemon or separate vector DB before measurable corpus size/latency need.
  Non-goal: GBC binary cache or FlatBuffers schema for graph/RAG before JSON slice becomes too large or multi-language binary readers are required.
  Non-goal: old PVRG wholesale port, graph database source of truth, persisted visual layout, provider transcript replay or prompt stuffing.
  Deferred trigger: revisit vector/ANN/GBC only after JSON graph retrieval is correct, tested and too slow or too large for current use.
Цель:
  Keep the rebuild focused on a minimal, explainable and replaceable graph/RAG slice.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: pvrg-minimal-nongoals
  protocol.id: pvrg-graph-rag-minimal
  trace.status: verified
]>
